        "text": {
            "description_html": "<b>Brass Accents I08-P7530-627 3 House Number Address Plate</b>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nModern colors and traditional styling grant this Three Number Address Plate a place in today's eclectic decorating trends. The 3-3/4\" high satin aluminum numbers really stand out against the black plate making this house number easy to read from the street.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nFor use with <b>Three (3) Numbers</b>. The entire address numbers and frame are made of non-rusting aluminum with a satin powder coat finish. Packaged with mounting screws and anchors for easy installation. \r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<!-- <p>\r\nAlso available: <a href=\"/products/four-number-address-plate-brass-accents-i08-p7540-627\"><b>4 Number Address Plate</b></a> - <a href=\"/products/five-number-address-plate-assembly-brass-accents-i08-p7550-627\"><b>5 Number Address Plate</b></a>\r\n</p> -->\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<a href=\"/collections/numbers-and-letters\"><img src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/3-al-house-address-plate-example.jpg?v=1704442267\" width=\"430\" height=\"300\" border=\"0\" alt=\"Brass Accents 3 House Number Address Plate Example\"></a>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Specifications</b> for the Brass Accents I08-P7530-627 3 House Number Address Plate:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Plate Width: 10-5/8\"</li>\r\n<li>Plate Height: 6\"</li>\r\n<li>Plate Projection: 9/16\"</li>\r\n<li>Number Height: 3-3/4\"</li>\r\n<li>Material: Non-Rusting Aluminum and Brass</li>\r\n<li>Finish: <b>Satin Aluminum</b></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nComes complete with 3 numbers, frame, back plate and mounting screws for easy installation. Assembled and Finished in the USA. Usually ships in one week.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nBelow select your 3 address numbers in the order required. \r\n</p>\r\n<p>\r\n<br><br><br>\r\n<b>** This item is Discontinued</b>\r\n<br><br><br>\r\n</p>",
